            "review_text": "capsicum0620\nThailand\n1173 contributions\n0\nAmong the best craft Vietnamese beers\nOct 2025 • Couples\nAmazing selection of craft beers. May be the best one, along with Heart of...\nThe service is very friendly, premises are clean and the quality of the beers is high-end.\nGrats on the Rice Beers section. Not all of them turned out great, but the initiative is laudable.\nNow, you like industrial beers, this is not a place for you: you'll find the beers challenging and expensive; and there are many bars serving Saigon beer and Heineken around.. why bother disturbing craft beer aficinados??\n7 Bridges for ever!!!!!\nRead more\nWritten October 29, 2025\nTravis H\nWhooo! I think you are the top 7 Bridges fan!\nWritten December 22, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
