            "review_text": "Alex G\n3 contributions\n0\nPoor food and inadequate response to my complaint\nApr 2024 • Couples\nThe burger was obviously dreadful old meat and I complained but nothing was done. The onion rings however were delicious the best I have ever tasted including the USA get it together guys also need staff training\nInsider tip:\nstaff training required\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 6, 2024\nTravis H\nI'm sorry to hear about your experience with the burger. We appreciate your feedback and will address it promptly to ensure better quality and service in the future. Thank you for letting us know about the onion rings; we're glad you enjoyed them. Rest assured, we'll work on improving staff training to provide a better overall experience.\nRead more\nWritten June 21, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
