            "review_text": "Ken C\n1 contribution\n0\nignored, no service\nMar 2024 • Solo\nthis is such a shame . I have been several times since it opened. I like it, but this time I realised that staff training was an issue and English comprehension. it is a western focussed bar so English speaking staff is the norm. I was greeted with a ns sat at the bar saying I knew what I wanted to drink. the menu was still pushed to me so I repeated that I know what I wanted and told the staff member. she walked away presumably to tell a barman.....there were three talking to each other behind the bar. she didn't and I was ignored. she came back later and explaining that I wanted their Nitro Stout she looked confused again and walked away. the barmen still ignored me. she talked to another staff member who came and looked equally confused. I gave up and left to a \"see you next time\" goodbye. I am not so sure about that.\nRead more\nService\nWritten March 28, 2024\nTravis H\nThank you for bringing this to our attention, and we sincerely apologize for the experience you had during your recent visit to our taproom. Providing excellent service and effective communication are top priorities for us, and it’s clear we fell short this time. We are actively working on enhancing our staff training, particularly in English proficiency, to better serve our diverse customer base. Your feedback is invaluable in helping us improve. We hope you'll consider giving us another chance to show you the service we strive to deliver. Please feel free to reach out to us directly if you have any further comments or suggestions. Thank you once again for your feedback.\nRead more\nWritten April 24, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
