            "review_text": "AGDowson\nPewsey, United Kingdom\n491 contributions\n0\nGreat craft beers, burgers & more\nFeb 2024 • Solo\nPassed this place by chance and it looked a nice place, I needed a bite to eat and a drink in the 36 degree heat. I had a burger ( lunchtime special ) it came with chips. One of the nicest burgers I’ve had, I went back the next day it was so good, a great selection of beers too.\nWritten February 26, 2024\nTravis H\nThanks so much for this lovely review Andrew. It's great to know you enjoyed the beer, lunch special and venue.\nWritten March 11, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
